# android-pins.rows — stage-spine-closure.sh's pin/face rosters, declared
# here and machine-spliced into the script by gen-staging-emit-closure.mjs
# (the staging-generated gate fails on drift). One `# block:` section per
# consumption site; the stage and verify twins splice from the SAME
# section, so they cannot drift apart. Declared rows must name
# materialized pins. The upstream/system-plugins whole-dir mirrors, the
# dsh-root file list and the scenario/web-live rosters stay with their own
# legs and mechanics (whole-dir mirrors are drift-free by construction).
# block: dsh-spine — the stage_pkg roster (vendor/dsh spine packages),
# spliced into the stage + verify `for pkg in` headers
