# block: dsh-npm-faces — the npm faces staged AT the vendor/dsh rel paths
# (the preset marker seeders walk vendor/dsh dirs only). The MOBILE
# PRESET'S SHELL SURFACE: tool-ralph/tool-pwsh are disabled rows today —
# health-skipped — and tool-bash's rows are !!js-gated; they ride so the
# three hosts stage the same surface and a mount leg finds the bytes.
# The Creator composition's plugin-management row (the mobile-absent
# patch leaves it enabled since the T-0170 round): its marker seeds from
# the vendor/dsh rel path like every npm face. The WEB plane's npm
# closure (the tool-web row, #335 B5): the dsh-web seam + the search-only
# tool — the turndown/domino/@joplin chain rides its own cp block.
plugin-manager
tool-bash
tool-present
tool-pwsh
tool-ralph
tool-web
